        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-204, Pretty Leaf and Berry Cabinet Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Leaf and Berry Cabinet Knob is perfect for adding an artful touch to your home. It is the perfect statement detail for all sorts of applications, be it in the kitchen, the bathroom, or on an end table in the living room. There are 6 finishes to choose from and each of those adds real beauty to the piece. Trust us when we say that the pictures do not do this pull justice.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/leaves-and-berries-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-404\"<b>CP-404 Leaf and Berry Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-204 Leaves and Berries Cabinet Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
